  "texts": {
    "preamble": "A.Sivasankaran vs Secretary To Government on 16 April, 2024 Author: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Bench: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy W.P. In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 16.04.2024 Coram The Hon'Ble Mr Justice D.Bharatha Chakravarthy W.P.No.9359 of 2024 A.Sivasankaran ... Pe -Versus- 1.Secretary to Government, Health and Family Welfare Department, Secretariat, Chennai 600 009. 2.The Commissioner, Food Safety and Drug Administrative Department , Anna Salai, Chennai 600 006. 3.The Designated Officer, Food Safety and Drug Administrative Department, 2nd floor, Collector Office Campus, Thiruvallur District 602 001. ... Re Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution of I Writ of Mandamus directing the respondents to consider the representatio the petitioner dated 29.01.2024 and consequently directing the responden pay additional charge allowance for working as additional charge food sa officer to Kadambatur Block and Ambattur Municipality from 03.02.2022 to date. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis 1 of 4 W For Petitioner : Mr.U.Jugal Kumar A.Sivasankaran vs Secretary To Government on 16 April, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/144776113/ 1 For Respondents : Mr.M.Bindhran, Additional Government Pleade Order",
    "facts": "This Writ Petition is filed to consider the representation of the petitioner and consequently to direct the respondents to pay the additional charge allowance for the petitioner, who is working as an additional charge Food Safety Officer. As per the said proceedings, it is stated that the Food Safety Officers menioned in the enclosure to the said proceedings were already sanctioned with an additional charge allowance at the rate mentioned therein.",
    "arguments": ""
